**Total for the year: €2,120**, which is **€706.67 each** for Sam, Priya and Tom. Rounding adds a cent, so one person could pay €706.66 instead.

Your list had February twice (198, 198). I treated that as a typo and counted it once, which gives 12 months. If February really was billed twice, the total is €2,318 and the split is €772.67 each.
